# Dawnstrike Vanguard: "At the beginning of your end step, if you control two or more tapped creatures, put a +1/+1 counter on each
# creature you control other than this creature" (CR 603.4, 122.1). Bot1 casts it with three Moxen and Black Lotus and two Memnites
# on turn one. On turn three the Vanguard and one Memnite attack (two tapped creatures, the Vanguard itself one of them, the lower
# bound): the end step puts a counter on both Memnites, the tapped and the untapped, and none on the Vanguard, and its lifelink
# gains 4. On turn five only one Memnite attacks (one tapped creature, just under the bound) and nothing is put on.

